   "textLength": 562,
   "text": "A compatible Linux host. The Kubernetes project provides generic instructions for Linux distributions\nbased on Debian and Red Hat, and those distributions without a package manager.\n2 GB or more of RAM per machine (any less will leave little room for your apps).\n2 CPUs or more for control plane machines.\nFull network connectivity between all machines in the cluster (public or private network is fi",
