   "id": "installing-kubeadm-kubelet-and-kubectl",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 39,
   "text": "Installing kubeadm, kubelet and kubectl",
   "counts": {
    "links": 1,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 1,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 0,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 4105,
    "height": 118,
    "widthFraction": 0.49,
    "leftFraction": 0.2,
    "pageFraction": 0.54,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 37,
   "tag": "ul",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 282,
   "text": "You will install these packages on all of your machines:\nkubeadm: the command to bootstrap the cluster.\nkubelet: the component that runs on all of the machines in your cluster\nand does things like starting pods and containers.\nkubectl: the command line util to talk to your cluster.",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 3,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 4,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 4239,
    "height": 168,
    "widthFraction": 0.49,
    "leftFraction": 0.2,
    "pageFraction": 0.56,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 38,
   "tag": "p×2",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 624,
   "text": "kubeadm will not install or manage kubelet or kubectl for you, so you will\nneed to ensure they match the version of the Kubernetes control plane you want\nkubeadm to install for you. If you do not, there is a risk of a version skew occurring that\ncan lead to unexpected, buggy behaviour. However, one minor version skew between the\nkubelet and the control plane is supported, but the kubelet version m",
   "counts": {
    "links": 1,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 2,
    "repeats": 2,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0.04,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 4423,
    "height": 184,
    "widthFraction": 0.49,
    "leftFraction": 0.2,
    "pageFraction": 0.59,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 39,
   "tag": "div",
   "class": "alert alert-danger",
   "role": "note",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 162,
   "text": "Warning:\nThese instructions exclude all Kubernetes packages from any system upgrades.\nThis is because kubeadm and Kubernetes require\nspecial attention to upgrade.",
   "counts": {
    "links": 1,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 1,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 0,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0.17,
